            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "Authorization",
              "value": "{{Authorization}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Returns the buyer's certification/compliance documents (sales tax exemption certificates, organic/quality certifications, etc.) with their lifecycle status and free-text notes. Documents filed by the onboarding extraction agent also carry a structured `extraction` object (jurisdiction, certificate number, issuing authority); manually uploaded documents have `extraction: null`. Read-only; ordered newest-first."
        },
        {
          "info": {
